{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24092","headline":"睡後茶兴忆杨同州 · 白居易","name":"睡後茶兴忆杨同州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨晚饮太多，嵬峩连宵醉。\n今朝餐又饱，烂熳移时睡。\n睡足摩挲眼，眼前无一事。\n信脚绕池行，偶然得幽致。\n婆娑绿阴树，斑駮青苔地。\n此处置绳牀，傍边洗茶器。\n白瓷瓯甚洁，红炉炭方炽。\n沫下麴尘香，花浮鱼眼沸。\n盛来有佳色，咽罢余芳气。\n不见杨慕巢，谁人知此味。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}